      "content": "English: Ephraim | French: Ephraim | Latin: Ephraim | Origin: &#1488;&#1462;;&#1508;&#1456;&#1512;&#1464;&#1497;&#1477;&#1501; | Vietnamese: Ép-ra-im 1 -- con ông Giu-se, em ông Mơ-na-se, St 41,52",
